  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Note: Only called for regular bean instances but not for existing\nproxy instances which implement <a href=\"../Advised.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>Advised</code></a> and allow for adding\nthe local <a href=\"../../Advisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>Advisor</code></a> to the existing proxy's <a href=\"../../Advisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>Advisor</code></a> chain.\nFor the latter, <a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Class)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.isEligible(Class)</code></a> is being called directly,\nwith the actual target class behind the existing proxy (as determined\nby <a href=\"../../support/AopUtils.html#getTargetClass(java.lang.Object)\"><code>AopUtils.getTargetClass(Object)</code></a>).",
      "translation": "注意：此方法仅针对普通 Bean 实例调用，而不适用于实现<a href=\"../Advised.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>Advised</code></a>接口并允许将本地<a href=\"../../Advisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>Advisor</code></a>添加到现有代理的<a href=\"../../Advisor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>Advisor</code></a>链中的现有代理实例。对于后者，会直接调用<a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Class)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.isEligible(Class)</code></a>，其实际目标类为现有代理背后的类（由<a href=\"../../support/AopUtils.html#getTargetClass(java.lang.Object)\"><code>AopUtils.getTargetClass(Object)</code></a>确定）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses may customize the handling of the target instance and in\nparticular the exposure of the target class. The default introspection\nof interfaces for non-target-class proxies and the configured advisor\nwill be applied afterwards; <a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#customizeProxyFactory(org.springframework.aop.framework.ProxyFactory)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.customizeProxyFactory(ProxyFactory)</code></a> allows for\nlate customizations of those parts right before proxy creation.",
      "translation": "子类可以自定义目标实例的处理方式，特别是目标类的暴露方式。随后将应用非目标类代理的接口默认内省以及配置的顾问；<a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#customizeProxyFactory(org.springframework.aop.framework.ProxyFactory)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.customizeProxyFactory(ProxyFactory)</code></a> 允许在代理创建之前对这些部分进行后期自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates to <a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Class)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.isEligible(Class)</code></a> for target class checking.\nCan be overridden, for example, to specifically exclude certain beans by name.",
      "translation": "委托给 <a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Class)\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.isEligible(Class)</code></a> 进行目标类检查。可以重写此方法，例如专门通过名称排除某些 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Extension of <a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</code></a> which implements\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, adds exposure of the original target class for each\nproxied bean (<a href=\"AutoProxyUtils.html#ORIGINAL_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>AutoProxyUtils.ORIGINAL_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>),\nand participates in an externally enforced target-class mode for any given bean\n(<a href=\"AutoProxyUtils.html#PRESERVE_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>AutoProxyUtils.PRESERVE_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>).\nThis post-processor is therefore aligned with <a href=\"AbstractAutoProxyCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\"><code>AbstractAutoProxyCreator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "扩展了实现<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>的<a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</code></a>，为每个代理bean暴露原始目标类（<a href=\"AutoProxyUtils.html#ORIGINAL_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>AutoProxyUtils.ORIGINAL_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>），并参与任何给定bean的外部强制目标类模式（<a href=\"AutoProxyUtils.html#PRESERVE_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>AutoProxyUtils.PRESERVE_TARGET_CLASS_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>）。因此，该后置处理器与<a href=\"AbstractAutoProxyCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\"><code>AbstractAutoProxyCreator</code></a>保持一致。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#prepareProxyFactory(java.lang.Object,java.lang.String)\">AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#prepareProxyFactory(java.lang.Object,java.lang.String)\">AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Object,java.lang.String)\">AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor.html#isEligible(java.lang.Object,java.lang.String)\">AbstractAdvisingBeanPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
