      "source": "the ProxyFactory, initialized with this processor's\n<a href=\"../ProxyConfig.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyConfig</code></a> settings and the specified bean",
      "translation": "由该处理器的<a href=\"../ProxyConfig.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyConfig</code></a>配置和指定的 bean 初始化的 ProxyFactory。",
      "count": 2
