    {
      "source": "Invoked after the population of normal bean properties\nbut before an initialization callback such as\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> or a custom init-method.",
